<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24200" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεσπ-όσυνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>P.</u>
			4.267
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or
				<i>belonging to the master</i> or <i>lord,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Cer.</u>
					144
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόμοι δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					942
				</span></i>
			(lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλαθρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					42
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δ. χρήματα</span>
			<i>the master's</i> property, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				9.16
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεσπόσυνα, τά,</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				14.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				p.24J.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἀνάγκαι</span>”
				<i>arbitrary rule,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					587
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); also, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς δεσποίνης, γόνατα</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Tim.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				136
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεσπότης</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Tyrt.
				6.2
			</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lyc.</u>
				28
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Anaxandr.
				41.33
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				4334
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Megiste</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			=
			<i>verna,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				846.13
			</span></i>.</div>
